Value PORT (\S+)
Value NATIVE_VLAN (\S+)
Value MODE (\S+)
Value TYPE (\S+)
Value ENABLED (yes|no)
Value STATUS (\w+)
Value REASON (.*?)
Value SPEED (\d+|--)
Value DESCRIPTION (\S.*)

Start
  ^${PORT}\s+${NATIVE_VLAN}\s+${MODE}\s+${TYPE}\s+${ENABLED}\s+${STATUS}\s+${REASON}\s+${SPEED}\s+${DESCRIPTION}\s*$$ -> Record